# ============================================================
# Vercel personal access token (recommended for auto-deploy)
# ============================================================
# When this is set, deploy_vercel.bat and auto_deploy.bat will pass it via
# `vercel --token`, so they never get stuck on an expired browser login.
#
# How to create one:
#   1. Sign in to https://vercel.com/account/tokens
#   2. Click "Create Token"
#   3. Name it (e.g. "spp-utilisasi local") and pick an expiration
#      (you can choose "No Expiration" for a hands-off setup)
#   4. Copy the token and paste it below
#   5. Save this file as `.env` (NOT .env.example)
#
# Leave blank to fall back to the saved `vercel login` session. If that
# session has expired, the deploy scripts will automatically launch
# `vercel login` for you.
VERCEL_TOKEN=
